  "translation": "Na Hanamel pikinini bilong dangai bilong mi i kam long mi — olsem tok bilong Yahwe — long yalta bilong kalabus, na i tok long mi: Baim plis ⟨את⟩ gaden we i stap long Anatot, we i stap long graun bilong Binyamin, long wanem raet bilong kot bilong kisim olgeta i stap long yu, na raet bilong baim bek i stap long yu — baim bilong yu. Na mi save long wanem em i tok bilong Yahwe.",
